# INV-03 — invented. Three overs a side in a league: the scores level, the tie stands.
# Edge cases: a bowler injured mid-over and another finishing it — six dots,
# and a maiden for neither (neither bowled a whole over); the bowler who
# finished it bowling again later; a leg bye; a stumping; a chase level on
# the last ball.
